      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1360381613,
      "text": "Cymbopogon schoenanthus, the camel grass, camel's hay, straw of Mecca, fever grass, geranium grass, or West Indian lemon grass, is a herbal plant of Southern Asia and Northern Africa, with fragrant foliage."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Cymbopogon schoenanthus",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cymbopogon_schoenanthus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 233929635,
      "text": "Cymbopogon schoenanthus, la Citronnelle du désert ou le Jonc odorant, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Poacées, croissant dans les paysages arides du nord de l'Afrique et du Proche-Orient."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Cymbopogon schoenanthus",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cymbopogon_schoenanthus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29900803,
      "text": "Cymbopogon schoenanthus, yang dikenal sebagai rumput unta, jerami unta, jerami Mekkah, rumput demam, rumput geranium, atau serai Hindia Barat, adalah tanaman herbal yang berasal dari Asia bagian selatan dan Afrika bagian utara, dengan dedaunan yang harum."
    }
